## Preamble

AerOS is built to be used, explored, taken apart, and learned from — by the people who are curious enough to run an experimental operating system on their own machines, for their own reasons. This license exists to keep it that way: free for individuals, off-limits for anyone looking to build a business on it without asking first.

What follows is legally binding. Read it as such. But know that it was written to protect a simple idea, not to trip you up.

