**"Derivative Work"** means any work based on, derived from, modified from, or incorporating all or a substantial portion of the Software, including modifications, translations, ports, and combinations with other software.

**"You" / "Individual"** means a single natural person acting in a personal capacity. It does **not** include a company, partnership, nonprofit, government body, educational institution, or other organization — nor a natural person acting on behalf of, for the benefit of, at the direction of, or within the scope of their role for any such organization.

