&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;**(b)** intended for, directed toward, or reasonably likely to result in, commercial advantage or monetary compensation, whether direct or indirect; **or**

&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;**(c)** part of, or in support of, any product, service, workflow, or offering — including internal tools, research, or operations — for which any party charges a fee, receives compensation, or derives business value, directly or indirectly.

